with the close of the preceding chapter shews that the establishment of the Christian Church, in consequence of the abrogation of the Mosaic dispensation, and the destruction of Jerusalem by the Romans, was intended. But, though it has in a measure been fulfilling ever since these events, yet its grand accomplishment must still be future.</p>\n<p>they. 1Ki 4:25; Isa 26:16; Zec 3:10 none. Isa 54:14; Jer 23:5,6; Eze 34:25,28; 38:11; 39:26 for. Isa 1:20; 40:5; 58:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-4-5","title":"Micah 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>all. 2Ki 17:29,34; Jer 2:10,11 and we. Ge 17:1; Ps 71:16; Isa 2:5; Zec 10:12; Col 2:6; 3:17 the name. Ex 3:14,15; Ps 48:14; 145:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-4-6","title":"Micah 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>will I. 2:12; Ps 38:17; Isa 35:3-6; Jer 31:8; Eze 34:13-17; Zep 3:19 Heb 12:12,13 and I. Ps 147:2; Isa 56:8; Jer 3:18; 30:17,18; Eze 34:12,13; 36:24 Eze 37:21,22; 39:25-29; Lu 19:10; Joh 10:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-4-7","title":"Micah 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I will. 2:12; 5:3,7,8; 7:18; Isa 6:13; 10:21,22; 11:11-16; 49:21-23; 60:22 Isa 66:8; Ho 1:10; Zec 9:13-17; 10:5-12; Ro 11:5,6,25-27 and the. Ps 2:6; Isa 9:6,7; 24:23; Da 7:14,27; Joe 3:17; Lu 1:33; Re 11:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-4-8","title":"Micah 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>O tower.The Targumist applies these words to the Messiah: \"But thou, O Messiah, who art hidden because of the sins of the congregation of Zion, the kingdom shall come unto thee.\"</p>\n<p>Ps 48:12,13; Isa 5:2; Mt 21:33; Mr 12:1 the flock. or, Edar. Ge 35:21 the strong. 2Sa 5:7; Isa 10:32; Zec 9:12 the first. Nu 24:19; Da 2:44; 7:18; Ob 1:21; Zec 9:10; Eph 1:21; Re 22:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-4-9","title":"Micah 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>why. Jer 4:21; 8:19; 30:6,7 is there. Isa 3:1-7; La 4:20; Ho 3:4; 10:3; 13:10,11 for. Isa 13:8; 21:3; 26:17; Jer 22:23; 30:6; 50:43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-4-10","title":"Micah 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>and labour. Isa 66:7-9; Ho 13:13; Joh 16:20-22 shalt thou. 2Ki 20:18; 25:4; 2Ch 33:11; 36:20; Ho 1:10; 2:14; Re 12:14 there shalt. 7:8-13; Ezr 1:1,2; Isa 45:13; 48:20; 52:9-12; Zec 2:7-9 redeem. Ps 106:10; Jer 15:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-4-11","title":"Micah 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>many. Isa 5:25-30; 8:7,8; Jer 52:4; La 2:15,16; Joe 3:2-15 let our. 7:10; Ob 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-4-12","title":"Micah 4:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>they know. Isa 55:8; Jer 29:11; Ro 11:33,34 for he shall. Isa 21:10; Joe 3:12,13; Zec 14:1-3; Lu 3:17; Re 14:14-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-4-13","title":"Micah 4:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>and thresh. Isa 41:15,16; Jer 51:33 hoofs. De 33:25; Isa 5:28 thou shalt. 5:8-15; Da 2:44; Zec 9:13-15; Re 2:26,27 I will consecrate. Jos 6:19; 2Sa 8:10,11; Ps 68:29; 72:10; Isa 18:7; 23:18; 60:6-9 Ro 15:25-28; 1Co 16:2; Re 21:24-26 the Lord of. Zec 4:14; 6:5</p>"}]}